@.s769 = private unnamed_addr constant [411 x i8] c"    {\22code\22: \22E0440\22, \22title\22: \22The program ran out of stack or memory\22, \22match\22: [\22stack overflow\22, \22out of memory\22, \22too many boxes\22, \22too many to hold in memory\22, \22too large to hold in memory\22], \22text\22: \22A recursion that never stops uses up the stack. Very large data can use up memory.\22, \22example\22: \22func f(n) \5C{ return f(n + 1) }\5Cnf(0)\22, \22fix\22: \22Give the recursion a base case, or work on smaller data.\22},\00"
